abstract: >-
  VisionValueBench studies visual value leakage in multilingual text-to-image
  generation. This repository releases the benchmark scenarios, construction
  and evaluation prompts, frozen automatic votes, numerical analysis, and a
  reference implementation of the two-layer SAE/IAE evaluation.
